This Ubuntu 24.04 amd64 package privately bundles the exact runtime wheels
listed in packaging/requirements-preview-ubuntu-24.04-x86_64-cp312.txt.

- sounddevice: MIT
- websockets: BSD-3-Clause
- cffi: MIT
- pycparser: BSD

Each wheel's own metadata and license files are retained below
/usr/lib/open-voice-input-linux/python/*.dist-info/. The package build rejects
missing, additional, version-mismatched, or hash-mismatched runtime wheels.
